guide forever/class/druid/dungeon-set-2
title Feralheart Raiment (Dungeon Set 2)
category Class
class Druid
folder Druid
levels 58-60
zone Ironforge
keywords Dungeon Set 2, Tier 0.5, T0.5, Feralheart Raiment, Wildheart Raiment, Dungeon Set 1, Deliana, Mokvar, An Earnest Proposition, A Supernatural Device, Mux Manascrambler, Ectoplasmic Distiller, Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer, Just Compensation, Anthion Harmon, Dead Man's Plea, Ysida Harmon, Falrin Treeshaper, The Challenge, Theldren, Anthion's Parting Words, Bodley, Three Kings of Flame, Lord Valthalak, Brazier of Beckoning, Saving the Best for Last, Stratholme, Dire Maul, Blackrock Depths, Blackrock Spire, Scholomance
reward text Feralheart Raiment: your class's Dungeon Set 2, eight pieces, each traded for its Wildheart Raiment piece
why The level 60 upgrade of your Wildheart Raiment: a long chain, most of it dungeon runs for a group.

# The Dungeon Set 2 chain, Forever's copies for this class on each side (data/forever quests.json with
# forever-db/corrections): An Earnest Proposition, A Supernatural Device (8922/8923), The Ectoplasmic
# Distiller (8921), Hunting for Ectoplasm (8924), A Portable Power Source (8925), A Shifty Merchant (8928),
# Return to Deliana/Mokvar (8977/8978), Just Compensation, In Search of Anthion (8929/8930), Dead Man's Plea
# (8945), Proof of Life (8946), Anthion's Strange Request (8947), Anthion's Old Friend (8948), Falrin's
# Vendetta (8949), The Instigator's Enchantment (8950), The Challenge (9015), Anthion's Parting Words,
# Bodley's Unfortunate Fate (8960/9032), Three Kings of Flame (8961), the class group's Components of
# Importance, Left Piece, More Components of Importance and Right Piece, I See Alcaz Island In Your
# Future... (8970), Final Preparations (8994), Mea Culpa, Lord Valthalak (8995), Return to Bodley (8996),
# Back to the Beginning (8997/8998), Saving the Best for Last.
# Costs: 20 gold (An Earnest Proposition's text), 40 gold (The Ectoplasmic Distiller), the Fel Elemental
# Rod 40 gold and the Hallowed Brazier 133g 33s 33c before reputation discounts, Honored with the Argent
# Dawn to buy it (the client's item tables). Quest drops are quest-only loot, so nothing is gathered early
# but what can be bought or crafted.
# Group content: every quest whose work is a dungeon, a summoned boss or elites asks first (`when group`).

step Deliana
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip What the chain asks, so you can plan: about 30 quests from Tanaris to Blackrock Mountain. The first part is solo (Gadgetzan, the Burning Steppes, Silithus, Winterspring, the Eastern Plaguelands). Then come runs of Stratholme, Dire Maul, Blackrock Depths, Lower and Upper Blackrock Spire and Scholomance, a summoned Duke in Silithus, two bosses your class's brazier calls, Lord Valthalak, and elites in the open world: that part needs a group, and the guide asks before each quest of it. Deliana stands in the High Seat, King Magni's throne room.
  note Before you start, gather what can be bought or crafted, so you never ride back for it: a Delicate Arcanite Converter (engineers make it), 4 Greater Eternal Essence, 10 Stonescale Oil (alchemists make it), a stack of Goblin Rocket Fuel, 3 Dark Iron Bars, 20 Enchanted Leather, 3 Mooncloth, 4 Cured Rugged Hides, 4 Dark Runes, 8 Large Brilliant Shards and a Flask of Supreme Power. Gold: 20, then 40, then 40 for the Fel Elemental Rod, and about 120-133 for the Hallowed Brazier, which needs Honored with the Argent Dawn.
  note Your eight Wildheart Raiment pieces are handed in along the way (bracers first, then belt and gloves, then boots, legs and shoulders, then helm and chest): bank spares, a hand-in takes the one in your bags. Where a hand-in offers a choice of pieces, each is cut for a different spec: take the one you play.
  level 59
  accept 84147

step Mokvar
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip What the chain asks, so you can plan: about 30 quests from Tanaris to Blackrock Mountain. The first part is solo (Gadgetzan, the Burning Steppes, Silithus, Winterspring, the Eastern Plaguelands). Then come runs of Stratholme, Dire Maul, Blackrock Depths, Lower and Upper Blackrock Spire and Scholomance, a summoned Duke in Silithus, two bosses your class's brazier calls, Lord Valthalak, and elites in the open world: that part needs a group, and the guide asks before each quest of it. Mokvar stands in Grommash Hold, in the Valley of Wisdom.
  note Before you start, gather what can be bought or crafted, so you never ride back for it: a Delicate Arcanite Converter (engineers make it), 4 Greater Eternal Essence, 10 Stonescale Oil (alchemists make it), a stack of Goblin Rocket Fuel, 3 Dark Iron Bars, 20 Enchanted Leather, 3 Mooncloth, 4 Cured Rugged Hides, 4 Dark Runes, 8 Large Brilliant Shards and a Flask of Supreme Power. Gold: 20, then 40, then 40 for the Fel Elemental Rod, and about 120-133 for the Hallowed Brazier, which needs Honored with the Argent Dawn.
  note Your eight Wildheart Raiment pieces are handed in along the way (bracers first, then belt and gloves, then boots, legs and shoulders, then helm and chest): bank spares, a hand-in takes the one in your bags. Where a hand-in offers a choice of pieces, each is cut for a different spec: take the one you play.
  level 59
  accept 84155

step Winterspring Blood Samples
  only Alliance
  zone Winterspring
  tip The Frostsabers and Shardtooth bears of northern Winterspring, north of Everlook, drop the samples (level 53-60, not elite: at 58 leave the level 60 Frostsaber Stalkers, Pride Watchers and Rabid Shardtooths alone). Fly to Everlook.
  level 59
  collect 21928 quest 84147.1

step Silithus Venom Samples
  only Horde
  zone Silithus
  tip The Stonelash scorpids, Sand Skitterers and Rock Stalkers of Silithus drop the samples (level 54-59, not elite). Fly to Cenarion Hold.
  level 59
  collect 22381 quest 84155.1

step Deliana: A Supernatural Device
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Bring the samples, 20 gold and your Wildheart Bracers: a rare drop from the mobs of Stratholme and Scholomance, or the auction house. She gives you a Sealed Blood Container for Mux in Gadgetzan.
  level 59
  collect 16714 quest 84147.2 @43.6,52.7  -- Wildheart Bracers
  turnin 84147
  accept 8922 npc 230319

