  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Bring the samples, 20 gold and your Wildheart Bracers: a rare drop from the mobs of Stratholme and Scholomance, or the auction house. He gives you a Sealed Blood Container for Mux in Gadgetzan.
  level 59
  collect 16714 quest 84155.2 @34.7,38.1 live  -- Wildheart Bracers
