step Mux Manascrambler
  zone Tanaris
  tip Mux works in the north-eastern hut of Gadgetzan, the engineers' hut. He builds the Ectoplasmic Distiller for 40 gold and the parts on your shopping list, plus 25 Volcanic Ash from the Burning Steppes.
  level 59
  turnin 8922 only Alliance
  turnin 8923 only Horde
  accept 8921

step Volcanic Ash
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Click the ash piles along the lava river in the west and centre of the Burning Steppes: each gives a few. They only drop while you have the quest.
  level 59
  collect 22338 quest 8921.4

step Mux Manascrambler: the Distiller
  zone Tanaris
  tip Hand in the parts and pay 40 gold: Mux pays you with Mux's Quality Goods, a bag holding 8 Goblin Rocket Fuel, and Hunting for Ectoplasm hands you the Ectoplasmic Distiller. Each placement of the distiller uses one fuel, so carry spares.
  level 59
  collect 16006 quest 8921.1 @52.4,27.3 live  -- Delicate Arcanite Converter
  collect 16203 quest 8921.2 @52.4,27.3 live  -- Greater Eternal Essence
  collect 13423 quest 8921.3 @52.4,27.3 live  -- Stonescale Oil
  turnin 8921
  accept 8924

step Scorched Ectoplasm
  zone Silithus
  tip Tortured Druids and Sentinels haunt Southwind Village (level 55-57, not elite), and silithid can join when they die. Ectoplasm only drops from a ghost that dies inside the Distiller's glow, which lasts a few minutes.
  level 59
  use 21946 quest 8924.1 @62.8,53.2 map 1451
  collect 21937 quest 8924.1

step Frozen Ectoplasm and the Fel Elemental Rod
  zone Winterspring
  tip The Suffering and Anguished Highborne around Lake Kel'Theril are level 54-56 and not elite. Ectoplasm only drops from a ghost that dies inside the distiller's glow, and the distiller lasts a few minutes. Vi'el, an imp, sells the Fel Elemental Rod (40 gold) in the cave at the mouth of Darkwhisper Gorge in the far south, where elite demons patrol the gorge. A Shifty Merchant asks for the rod later, so buying it now saves a trip back.
  level 59
  use 21946 quest 8924.2 @52.9,42.8 map 1452
  collect 21936 quest 8924.2
  buy 21939 npc 16015  -- Fel Elemental Rod

step Stable Ectoplasm
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Unseen Servants, Eyeless Watchers, Death Singers and Hate Shriekers (level 55-59, not elite) drop it, and Northdale in the north-east has many of them. Ectoplasm only drops from a ghost that dies inside the distiller's glow, which lasts a few minutes, and the shriekers cast fear.
  level 59
  use 21946 quest 8924.3 @45.5,46.7 map 1423 live
  collect 21935 quest 8924.3

step Mux Manascrambler: Magma Lord Bokk
  zone Tanaris
  tip Bring the distiller back with the ectoplasm: it is handed in too.
  level 59
  turnin 8924
  accept 8925

step Magma Lord Bokk
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Magma Lord Bokk (level 58-60, not elite) stands in a lava pool in the south-west of the Burning Steppes. His earth shock hits for about 600 and knocks you back; pull him away from the lava. Careful: elite dragonkin patrol nearby.
  level 59
  kill 16043
  collect 21938 quest 8925.1

step Mux Manascrambler: the Ghost Revealer
  zone Tanaris
  tip Mux takes the Magma Core, then asks for the Fel Elemental Rod you already have, and gives you the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer. Keep the Revealer to the end: it is the only way to see Anthion and Bodley.
  level 59
  turnin 8925
  accept 8928
  turnin 8928
  accept 8977 only Alliance
  accept 8978 only Horde

