step Anthion Harmon
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Anthion's ghost is on the bridge before Stratholme's main gate, at the north end of the Eastern Plaguelands. He can only be seen with the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer.
  use 22115 @26.1,11.3 map 1423 live
  turnin 8929 only Alliance
  turnin 8930 only Horde

step Dead Man's Plea
  when group 8945
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip From here the chain is group content. Dead Man's Plea: save Anthion's wife Ysida from Baron Rivendare in Stratholme with a group of five.
  level 59
  accept 8945

step Stratholme: the Baron in 45 minutes
  when group 8945
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Go in by the service entrance (the undead side). The gate behind it starts a 45-minute clock: kill the three ziggurat bosses, Ramstein and the waves after him, and start the fight with Baron Rivendare before the clock runs out (you only need to pull him in time). Then Ysida stands free in his room: talk to her there. The Baron also drops the Wildheart Kilt you need later.
  level 59
  complete 8945 @26.5,10.4 live group 5  -- Ysida Freed
  turnin 8945 @26.5,10.4 live  -- Ysida Harmon, in the Baron's room
  accept 8946 @26.5,10.4 live  -- she gives you her locket

