  tip Anthion's Strange Request takes 20 Enchanted Leather. Enchanters make it and the auction house has it; Lhara sells it at the Darkmoon Faire, which stands in Elwynn Forest or Mulgore in turn: go to the one where it is now.
  buy 12810 x20 npc 14846 @41.2,69.7 live  -- Enchanted Leather

