step Anthion's Old Friend
  when group 8948
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Anthion sends his incomplete Banner of Provocation to Falrin Treeshaper in the Athenaeum of Dire Maul West, a dungeon for a group of five.
  accept 8948

step Falrin Treeshaper
  when group 8948
  zone Feralas
  tip Dire Maul is in the High Wilderness of central Feralas. Falrin waits in the Athenaeum, the library at the far end of Dire Maul West: the West door needs the Crescent Key (Pusillin in Dire Maul East drops it) or a rogue's lockpicking. Falrin's Vendetta: 25 Ogre Warbeads from the Gordok ogres of Dire Maul North (a full run, not a tribute run, pays best; the Spirestone ogres of Lower Blackrock Spire drop them too, less often). They only drop while you have the quest.
  turnin 8948 @59.2,45.1 live group 5  -- Falrin Treeshaper, in the Athenaeum

step Falrin's Vendetta
  when group 8949
  zone Feralas
  level 59
  accept 8949 @59.2,45.1 live

step Ogre Warbeads
  when group 8949
  zone Feralas
  tip A Dire Maul North run with a group of five: kill every Gordok ogre on the way to King Gordok.
  level 59
  collect 21982 quest 8949.1 @59.2,45.1 live group 5
  turnin 8949 @59.2,45.1 live  -- Falrin Treeshaper: choose your reward

step The Instigator's Enchantment
  when group 8950
  zone Feralas
  tip Falrin wants a Jeering Spectre's Essence (the Eldreth ghosts of Dire Maul West, best the Eldreth Seethers, and the invisible spectres around Immol'thar's prison), 4 Dark Runes (the necromancers and summoners of Scholomance, whose gate opens to a Skeleton Key: one in the group is enough; or the auction house) and 8 Large Brilliant Shards (enchanters, or the auction house).
  level 59
  accept 8950 @59.2,45.1 live
  collect 22224 quest 8950.1 @59.2,45.1 live group 5  -- Jeering Spectre's Essence
  collect 20520 quest 8950.2 @59.2,45.1 live  -- Dark Rune
  collect 14344 quest 8950.3 @59.2,45.1 live  -- Large Brilliant Shard
  turnin 8950 @59.2,45.1 live

step The Challenge
  when group 9015
  zone Feralas
  tip Falrin finishes the Banner of Provocation, which is used at the Ring of Law in Blackrock Depths.
  level 59
  accept 9015 @59.2,45.1 live

step Blackrock Depths: the Ring of Law
  when group 9015
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Blackrock Depths is the dungeon inside Blackrock Mountain, between the Searing Gorge and the Burning Steppes; a group of five. Walk into the Ring of Law so High Justice Grimstone sentences you, and while he reads the sentence plant the Banner of Provocation in the middle of the ring. After the first wave, Theldren and his gladiators come instead of the usual boss: five elites who fight like players (crowd control, dispels, no taunts). Kill them all; Theldren drops the Top Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet.
  level 59
  use 21986 @34.8,85.3 live group 5  -- Banner of Provocation, in the ring
  kill 16059 quest 9015.1 @34.8,85.3 live group 5  -- Theldren
  collect 22047 quest 9015.2 @34.8,85.3 live  -- Top Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet

step Anthion Harmon: Anthion's Parting Words
  when group 9015
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Back to Anthion at Stratholme's gate (Ghost Revealer). Anthion's Parting Words takes your Wildheart Boots: Mother Smolderweb in Lower Blackrock Spire (about 16%), your Wildheart Kilt: Baron Rivendare in Stratholme (about 10%), and your Wildheart Spaulders: Gizrul the Slavener in Lower Blackrock Spire (about 18%).
  level 59
  turnin 9015
  accept 84179 only Alliance
  accept 84187 only Horde

