step The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet
  when group 8967
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Bodley gives you a Brazier of Beckoning.
  level 59
  accept 8967

step The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet: Isalien
  when group 8967
  zone Feralas
  tip A dungeon run for a group of five. Bodley's Brazier of Beckoning calls Isalien to the shrine by Alzzin the Wildshaper at the end of Dire Maul East: clear the area first. Use the brazier there, kill Isalien and loot the piece. She is an elite priestess spirit with a hippogryph at her side and strong heals: interrupt her or drain her mana. Keep the brazier: Bodley wants it back with the piece.
  level 59
  use 22050 @59.2,45.1 live group 5  -- Brazier of Beckoning: summons Isalien
  kill 16097 quest 8967.1 @59.2,45.1 live group 5  -- Isalien
  collect 21984 quest 8967.2 @59.2,45.1 live  -- Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet

