step More Components of Importance: Druidical Remains
  when group 8986
  zone Silithus
  tip At Hive'Regal, the silithid hive in south-eastern Silithus, the Hive'Regal silithid (level 59-61 elites) drop the Druidical Remains (players report anything from 5 to 50 kills). They are elites: bring a friend or two unless your gear is good. It drops only while you have the quest; everyone in the group with it can loot one.
  level 59
