step The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet: Mor Grayhoof
  when group 8989
  when group 8970
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip A dungeon run for a group of five. Bodley's Brazier of Beckoning calls Mor Grayhoof to War Master Voone's room in Lower Blackrock Spire, in Blackrock Mountain: clear the room and Voone first. Use the brazier there, kill Mor Grayhoof and loot the piece. He is an elite druid spirit: interrupt his heals and step out of his storm. Keep the brazier: Bodley wants it back with the piece. Then use the Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (Bodley gave it back to you) to join the pieces into Lord Valthalak's Amulet.
  level 59
  use 22049 @34.8,85.3 live group 5  -- Brazier of Beckoning: summons Mor Grayhoof
  kill 16080 quest 8989.1 @34.8,85.3 live group 5  -- Mor Grayhoof
