step Upper Blackrock Spire: Lord Valthalak
  when group 8995
  when group 8994
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip A raid of up to ten in Upper Blackrock Spire. Clear to The Beast's room and kill The Beast, then use the Brazier of Beckoning there to call Lord Valthalak (level 63 boss). Kill his shades quickly; in his last phase he hits the whole room hard. Use Lord Valthalak's Amulet on his corpse: his spirit appears. Give him the amulet, then take Return to Bodley from him.
